        "original_id": "8b0bb42b-6e51-5d9f-b538-a0a5a1034942",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Courtney Love, Patty Schemel, Kurt Cobain\n- Bands: Hole, Nirvana\n- Songs: \"Closing Time\", \"Drunk in Rio\", \"It's Closing Soon\"\n\nFacts:\n- Kurt Cobain was an American musician, artist, singer, songwriter, guitarist, and poet who was born on February 20, 1967, and died on April 5, 1994.\n- \"Closing Time\" is a song by the American alternative rock band Hole.\n- \"Closing Time\" was also referred to as \"Drunk in Rio\" and incorrectly as \"It's Closing Soon.\"\n- Courtney Love, Patty Schemel, and Kurt Cobain wrote \"Closing Time.\"\n- Courtney Love was the vocalist and rhythm guitarist of Hole.\n- Kurt Cobain was Courtney Love's husband and the frontman of Nirvana.",
